    <h2>Global Homicide Rate Overview</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <p>The global intentional homicide rate has followed a complex trajectory over the past three decades. Analyzing the median rate across all reporting countries — a robust measure that resists distortion from extreme outliers — reveals a general declining trend from 1990 to the present, punctuated by periods of stagnation and reversal.</p>

    <div class="chart-grid" style="margin: 20px 0;">
